<div class="studio-custom relative overflow-hidden"><div  id="ppolicyi"  class=""><div class="relative custom-container py-28"><h1 class="heading-underline text-white font-display text-4xl max-w-[30ch] mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1><div class="text-colorText-body max-w-[52ch] whitespace-pre-line"><p>Effective Date: 6/10/2024</p>
<p>Studio Say So respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal data. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and share information about you when you visit our website (the &#8220;Site&#8221;) and when you use our video production services.</p>
<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
<p>We collect information that you provide directly to us and information that we gather through automated methods.<br />
<strong>A. Information You Provide to Us:</strong></p>
<ul style="line-height: 0;">
<li style="list-style-type: none;">
<ul class="ulvl2" style="line-height: 0;">
<li>Contact Information: Name, email address, phone number, and mailing address.</li>
<li>Business Information: Company name, job title, and industry.</li>
<li>Project Details: Information about your video production needs, including project scope, objectives, and preferences.</li>
<li>Payment Information: Billing address and payment details (collected through secure payment processors).</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>B. Information We Collect Automatically:</strong></p>
<ul style="line-height: 0;">
<li style="list-style-type: none;">
<ul class="ulvl2" style="line-height: 0;">
<li>Usage Data: Information about your interaction with our Site, such as IP address, browser type, operating system, referral URLs, pages viewed, and time spent on our Site.</li>
<li>Cookies and Similar Technologies: We use cookies and similar technologies to collect data about your browsing activities. You can manage cookie preferences through your browser settings.</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
<p>We use the information we collect for various purposes, including:</p>
<ul class="ulvl2" style="line-height: 0;">
<li>Providing Services: To deliver our video production services, process transactions, and communicate with you about your projects.</li>
<li>Improving Our Site: To understand how users interact with our Site and to enhance the user experience.</li>
<li>Marketing and Communications: To send you promotional materials, newsletters, and updates about our services. You can opt-out of marketing communications at any time.</li>
<li>Compliance and Protection: To comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements.</li>
</ul>
<h2>3. How We Share Your Information</h2>
<p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share your information in the following ways:</p>
<ul class="ulvl2" style="line-height: 0;">
<li>Service Providers: With third-party vendors and service providers who perform services on our behalf, such as payment processing, email delivery, and website analytics.</li>
<li>Legal Requirements: When required by law or to protect our rights, safety, or property, and that of our users and others.</li>
</ul>
<h2>4. Data Security</h2>
<p>We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal data from unauthorized access, use, or disclosure. However, no internet transmission is entirely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
<h2>5. Your Rights and Choices</h2>
<p>You have certain rights regarding your personal data, including:</p>
<ul class="ulvl2" style="line-height: 0;">
<li>Access and Update: You can request access to or update your personal information.</li>
<li>Opt-Out: You can opt-out of receiving marketing communications from us by following the unsubscribe instructions in those communications or by contacting us directly.</li>
<li>Delete: You can request that we delete your personal data, subject to certain exceptions.</li>
</ul>
<h2>6. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on our Site with the effective date. Your continued use of our Site after any changes indicates your acceptance of the updated Privacy Policy.</p>
<h2>7. Contact Us</h2>
<p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us at:</p>
<div class="paddress">Studio Say So<br />
62 West Colonial Drive<br />
Suite 305<br />
Orlando, FL 32801</div>
<p>By using our Site and services, you consent to the terms of this Privacy Policy.</p>
</div></div></div></div>
